7678096721564630?hl\u003dzh-TW","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFsNrYsuafjSbt0X7E5rWEik69sKnj20Qv-llknSe-SmXRE-NpaA\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",null,null,"117067678096721564630"]]],[[[2],[[null,null,null,null,1]]]],[2,null,null,null,null,[null,null,null,[7,3]],null,null,[2026,5,6,9,null,null,null,null,["3 個月前"]]],["//www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d!1e10!2sCIABIhAbxpXx1ltCs90pynRgJ_o9\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0x55c12a1e4fba950"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","386204154587752784"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swM1gxVk9ZekpFV2xCaU4ySmZla2QyT1ZoWGJFRRAB"]],"CIABIhAbxpXx1ltCs90pynRgJ_o9",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["▫️新加坡叻沙豬肉片拉麵₁₄₅\n可以選粗麵、細麵或麵線\n我選細麵\n跟老闆說只要一半的麵因為怕吃不完\n裡面的料有豬肉片、三角豆腐、金針菇、高麗菜、豆皮、四季豆、半顆蛋\n會附上一小片檸檬\n豬肉片蠻多塊的\n其他料的量就偏少\n三角豆腐吸滿湯汁很夠味\n麵的份量真的非常多！\n我覺得湯頭可以再濃郁一點\n豬肉片感覺是用湯底煮的\n湯裡面的肉沫有點多\n建議店家可以分開煮讓湯底看起來清澈一點\n吃到最後麵體的最外層會有一點點糊糊的\n檸檬片太小塊所以加進湯裡沒什麼味道😂\n\n走進店裡就聞到叻沙湯的味道\n裝潢看起來有一種住家感\n有生活的痕跡～\n老闆很熱情\n我問老闆細麵和粗麵的差別\n老闆用店裡筷子的前端和後端來形容~\n不過實際吃的時候，覺得細麵比筷子的前端再細一點\n廚房好像只有老闆娘一個人在煮\n所以餐點需要稍微等一下\n美中不足的是我覺得桌面有一個臭抹布味（抹布可能需要消毒一下）\n之後有機會再去試試其他餐點！",null,[0,32]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/964779728293900252/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTFneFZrOVpla3BGVjJ4Q2FVNHlTbVpsYTJReVQxWm9XR0pGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/964779728293900252/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTFneFZrOVpla3BGVjJ4Q2FVNHlTbVpsYTJReVQxWm9XR0pGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/964779728293900252/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTFneFZrOVpla3BGVjJ4Q2FVNHlTbVpsYTJReVQxWm9XR0pGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/964779728293900252/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTFneFZrOVpla3BG